Licensing overview for CleanYourTV Viet Custom
==============================================

This distribution combines components with different license terms.
It must not be described as entirely MIT-licensed or unrestricted for
commercial use.

1. The CleanYourTV launcher code is copyright (c) 2026 Gathin and is
   distributed under the MIT License, preserved in:
   licenses/MIT-CleanYourTV.txt
   Custom additions other than the exceptions below are distributed
   under the same MIT terms.

2. VietnameseLunarDate.java is adapted from Ho Ngoc Duc's amlich-aa98
   calendar code. Its notice permits personal, non-commercial use,
   copying, modification and redistribution, subject to retaining the
   copyright and documentation notice. These terms are preserved in:
   licenses/AMLICH-NOTICE.txt
   This component is not relicensed under MIT by this distribution.

3. The unmodified Outfit font is distributed under SIL Open Font License
   1.1. See launcher/FONT-LICENSE-OFL.txt.

4. Gradle wrapper files retain their Apache License 2.0 notices.
   See licenses/Apache-2.0.txt.

Dependency licenses remain with their respective authors. No third-party
streaming applications are distributed. Four user-supplied wallpaper images
are included in launcher/app/src/main/assets/wallpapers. They are not
relicensed under MIT; their respective rights remain with the image authors
or rights holders. See docs/WALLPAPERS.md and WALLPAPER-SHA256.txt.

Retain this file, NOTICE.md, the applicable license texts, and source
copyright headers when redistributing. For uses outside the lunar
component's personal/non-commercial permission, obtain suitable permission
or replace it with a component whose license permits the intended use.
